# Plane x+y+z = 1, expressed as one large triangle.
#
# Regression test for Bug 1 (local vs global vertex index in convertIntersectionToIpoints).
# This plane passes exactly through three vertices of clay_unit_cube:
#   vertex 3  ( 1,  1, -1)  :  1+1-1 = 1  ✓
#   vertex 6  ( 1, -1,  1)  :  1-1+1 = 1  ✓
#   vertex 8  (-1,  1,  1)  : -1+1+1 = 1  ✓
#
# When the library computes the intersection of a knife edge with those clay faces
# it should detect that the intersection endpoints ARE existing clay vertices and
# store the global mesh index (after Bug 1's fix).  Before the fix, it stored the
# local face-vertex index (0, 1, or 2) which pointed to the wrong vertex.

v  4 -2 -1
v -2  4 -1
v -2 -2  5

f 1 2 3
